      "writtenOn": "2022-11-29T03:05:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just want to double confirm, when we want to deprecate API like this, and we already pass T release timeframe, is it ok to maxTargetSdk \u003d T here?\nI thought we need to maxTargetSdk \u003d U here and announce it in the next release, so when people receive U update, they will know it is the last version support this, and will have 1 year buffer time to change it.\nAm I missing something?\n+jchalard@ to input.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 230,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 230,
        "endChar": 68
      },
      "revId": "ae12ef618463d58b0233d5d4acee6d647c4aeb9a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5fb2309e_db26f3d7",
        "filename": "framework-t/src/android/net/NetworkTemplate.java",
        "patchSetId": 13
